/Title (As this is a new initiative, there are currently limited ways to generate estimates of how much waste has been diverted away from landfills, either through reduction or recycling. Fortunately, there are ways to approximate these values based on the number of guests, the type of event, how many containers are used, and by weight of materials. Using these values as proxies, data can be determined and used to measure the success of a zero waste event. Certain haulers and consulting services can provide these numbers for you.)
